## Prerequisites

Four self-contained, reusable results are proved in separate files:
* `DiscreteSW/Auto/MarcinkiewiczInterpolation.lean`: the Marcinkiewicz interpolation theorem
  (Blueprint Lemma 2.3, `lem:interpolation`);
* `DiscreteSW/Auto/HardyLittlewoodMaximal.lean`: the Hardy–Littlewood maximal theorem for the
